cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "ACTIONetExperiment: an AnnData-shaped container for single-cell omics in R"
abstract: >-
  ACTIONetExperiment (ACE) extends SummarizedExperiment to match the structure
  of Python AnnData objects, adding first-class containers for row and column
  reductions, embeddings, networks, and their metadata. ACE objects are usable
  wherever SummarizedExperiment or SingleCellExperiment objects are expected.
type: software
